1
00:04:50,526 --> 00:04:56,526
Evil takes many forms.

2
00:09:41,052 --> 00:09:47,052
The Witch is a horror, fantasy, drama film directed by Robert Eggers.

3
00:14:31,578 --> 00:14:37,578
In 1630, a farmer relocates his family to a remote plot of land on the
edge of a forest where strange, unsettling things happen.

4
00:19:22,105 --> 00:19:28,105
With suspicion and paranoia mounting, each family member's
faith, loyalty and love are tested in shocking ways.

5
00:24:12,631 --> 00:24:18,631
Thomasin, played by Anya Taylor-Joy.

6
00:29:03,157 --> 00:29:09,157
William, played by Ralph Ineson.

7
00:33:53,684 --> 00:33:59,684
Katherine, played by Kate Dickie.

8
00:38:44,210 --> 00:38:50,210
Caleb, played by Harvey Scrimshaw.

9
00:43:34,736 --> 00:43:40,736
Mercy, played by Ellie Grainger.

10
